# Agent Instructions

## MANDATORY: Agent Change Logging
Whenever you create, edit, or delete any files in this project:
1. You MUST log the changes in `AGENT_CHANGELOG.md` before completing your turn.
2. The log entry must follow the format in `AGENT_CHANGELOG.md` and include:
   - Timestamp
   - Role (e.g. Agent 1 — CRM Specialist, Agent 2 — Flutter Specialist, etc.)
   - Triggered By: `GitHub: komilkomil3000-afk | System: komeil`
   - Files modified/created/deleted
   - Detailed description of changes
   - Verification checks executed
3. You can execute: `node scripts/append_agent_changelog.js` to automatically append your changes.
